rep("| **Horror Entities** (designed; soft) | none | `DERELICT_LOADED` / `DERELICT_UNLOADED`, `POD_DEPARTED`, `ring_of(section)` | Horror |",
"| **Horror Entities** (designed; soft) | none | `ring_of(section)`; `web.view` reads in its hook (`pod_at`, `transit_state`, `leg_dir`, `leg_origin_id`, `leg_target_id`, `nodes[].loaded`, or the Graph's `section().dormant` directly; WM-31) in place of the events `DERELICT_LOADED` / `DERELICT_UNLOADED` and `POD_DEPARTED`, which Horror does not subscribe to (a hook owner never subscribes, CR-10; the events remain Audio's presentation notifications); Horror reads no `web.save_seq()` (that read is Save/Load's facet only, WM-31) *(Amended 2026-10-29 — sync knock-on fix, round 3)* | Horror |");
rep("| Horror Entities | it depends on this | Soft | `DERELICT_LOADED` / `DERELICT_UNLOADED`, `POD_DEPARTED`, `ring_of` | designed (2026-10-27) |",
"| Horror Entities | it depends on this | Soft | `ring_of`; `web.view` reads (`pod_at`, `transit_state`, `leg_dir`, `leg_origin_id`, `leg_target_id`, `nodes[].loaded`; WM-31), no event subscription and no `web.save_seq()` (Save/Load only); the events `DERELICT_LOADED` / `DERELICT_UNLOADED` and `POD_DEPARTED` are Audio's *(Amended 2026-10-29 — sync knock-on fix, round 3)* | designed (2026-10-27) |");
fs.writeFileSync(p,s);
EOF
node "$TEMP/e.js" && git diff --stat -- design/gdd/web-map-and-transit.md | tail -1

